 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AY-e-BhphJQQ7kNvwFUdPsN&_nc_oc=Adoq9RXCaFVEShbP8nhRMHLhm6T1HnTc8CpZzonJkte4hXaH3RODLF4QTCbl9GcBnF4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE1kZ-sinn_E9e4QrXGuZkuHA3PfJAOKq4j9ADwhkUKww&oe=6A819C81"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=53H6vJ3aJq0Q7kNvwFlyW44&_nc_oc=AdoQ-5_T0lg_0yRF8m8a8jPlg-9AFi46cr4HWualKyaLtJS4e-ApTMceBPs2DrE3GS8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFr1bw2vZJ2_o_nia9_rrhzk8lt4-ScVzPWQVwj3p4PMg&oe=6A81A9E6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EDUlIqomlJoQ7kNvwF-WbLK&_nc_oc=Adp74ZVUR20C9ss0FdPeeKOTfb1K9QD9cCKahlYXrCB_jdnHHzVDrmgPh0uTunZnnzM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQELipiqktAl7sibWb4JWm3wwkAobPUt2wzJ8wQqQ8FBmA&oe=6A81B3DC"}, {"fil